    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>This tiny vial holds a single application of magic perfume. You can take a Magic action to apply it to yourself, and its effect lasts 1 hour. For the duration, you have Advantage on Charisma (Deception and Persuasion) checks made to influence a creature within 5 feet of yourself.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-8yC9vFxC2CdAOLyx\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’effet donne l’Avantage à tous les tests de Tromperie et de Persuasion : il ne vaut que face à une créature à 5 pieds ou moins.</p></section>",
